  262                      ;=============================================================================
  263                      ;  INPUT DATA -- this is what ends up in hex_init.txt.
  264                      ;  Chosen for toggling: all-ones and all-zeros, the two checkerboards, byte
  265                      ;  and half-word patterns, walking ones, the two extremes of the signed range,
  266                      ;  and some unstructured values.  The a/b pairs are deliberately mismatched so
  267                      ;  slt vs sltu disagree on several of them and the multiplier sees both small
  268                      ;  and full-width operands.
